  m_text: 'An old dusty man raises an eyebrow which shares remarking similarities
    with a broom.

    With great vigor, you dump the contents of your worn-out backpack
    on the poor saps counter. This action is met with merely a vacant and profoundly
    confused stare. After bartering, you obtain receive the armor piece you were
    longing for, the brass gauntlets.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5302535af1044152a457ed104f1f4b91, type: 2}
